  "item_short_desc": "<p>Stay comfortable in harsh winter conditions with Rothco&rsquo;s Fur Flyer's Hat. Crafted with a water-resistant outer shell made from rugged polyester rip-stop, this cold weather hat offers durability and protection against the elements. The faux fur accents provide essential warmth throughout the cap, ensuring comfort during cold weather adventures. Featuring a dual set of adjustable ear flaps&mdash;both upper and lower&mdash;the outdoor hat offers versatile wear to suit your desired level of warmth.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
